cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "CAMEO: Catalog of Architecture Metadata and Experimental Outcomes"
message: "If you use CAMEO, please cite it as below. To credit one study, use Cite on that study's page."
abstract: "An open database of the models that studies train, including those that never reach the paper: what each model was, how it was trained, and how it performed. Each entry is one JSON file."
authors:
  - name: "CAMEO contributors"
license: "MIT"
url: "https://cameo-db.github.io"
repository-code: "https://github.com/cameo-db/cameo-db.github.io"
keywords:
  - machine learning
  - model architecture
  - reproducibility
  - benchmarks
